<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP year copper concs output rises 33 pct.</title>
<headline>BHP year copper concs output rises 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The world's second largest copper company, the Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP), said on Tuesday its production of copper concentrates rose 33 percent to 756,000 tonnes in the year ended May 31 over the previous year.</p>
</text>
